      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh just got back to nyc after that crazy long flight from singapore. im feeling super wiped and my breathing feels kinda weird/heavy like i cant quite get a full breath, and my left calf is killing me. probably just massive dehydration and jet lag right? i dont really wanna deal with an er visit if i can just sleep it off.",
